  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the proposed intervention is to stimulate development of responsible agriculture as a driver of economic growth and poverty reduction, in line with objectives set out in key national policy documents and in the SAGCOT blueprint. The specific purpose is to contribute to the establishment of the enabling conditions for sustainable agricultural transformation in priority the Kilombero SAGCOT cluster and promote promote the participation inclusion of smallholder farmers in t</narrative>
  </description>
